    "detailed_description": "A Pacific island where a legendary female pilot has vanished.<br>Her daughter and a detective pursue clues to her disappearance amid threats from mutants roaming the forest.<br>Mysterious phone calls, forgotten medications... The closer they get to her, the more the island's mysteries slowly unfold.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cInteractive\u201d Puzzles</h2>Flying arrows can catch fire, and the fire spreads to the box with the fire arrow stuck in it. The fire explodes the bomb, which destroys the cheese stone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/a991a85780f1aedd54c0cc9f1a94896c.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/a991a85780f1aedd54c0cc9f1a94896c.webm?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/a991a85780f1aedd54c0cc9f1a94896c.mp4?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Boss</h2>Survive battles against massive bosses with diverse patterns.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/4598a8259b19c332428ebd56d5d2db95.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/4598a8259b19c332428ebd56d5d2db95.webm?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/4598a8259b19c332428ebd56d5d2db95.mp4?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cChain Action\u201d of Puzzles</h2>Player actions can create a chain reaction. If you light a barrel and throw it into a bush, the flames will spread and enemies will be hit by fire.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/91c16addb6b8d506d762c6d6f095c5aa.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/91c16addb6b8d506d762c6d6f095c5aa.webm?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/91c16addb6b8d506d762c6d6f095c5aa.mp4?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interesting Dungeon Mechanics</h2>Encounter fascinating dungeon mechanics, much like riding a waterslide.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/adbd105eec2db48c0792526dc0ea4cfb.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/adbd105eec2db48c0792526dc0ea4cfb.webm?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/adbd105eec2db48c0792526dc0ea4cfb.mp4?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Skills</h2>There are multiple weapons, and each weapon has multiple skills. Use your weapon according to the situation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/6dd3ea64ae4b3b3e06c6fa2988f49111.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/6dd3ea64ae4b3b3e06c6fa2988f49111.webm?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/6dd3ea64ae4b3b3e06c6fa2988f49111.mp4?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn skills and explore hidden places</h2>There are hidden places throughout the map. Each time you learn a skill, you can explore more hidden places.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/ab65b15c1e7331078aca455554b08960.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/ab65b15c1e7331078aca455554b08960.webm?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/ab65b15c1e7331078aca455554b08960.mp4?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
