t a barrel and throw it into a bush, the flames will spread and enemies will be hit by fire.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/91c16addb6b8d506d762c6d6f095c5aa.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/91c16addb6b8d506d762c6d6f095c5aa.webm?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/91c16addb6b8d506d762c6d6f095c5aa.mp4?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interesting Dungeon Mechanics</h2>Encounter fascinating dungeon mechanics, much like riding a waterslide.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/adbd105eec2db48c0792526dc0ea4cfb.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/adbd105eec2db48c0792526dc0ea4cfb.webm?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/adbd105eec2db48c0792526dc0ea4cfb.mp4?t=1754899853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Skills</h2>There are multiple weapons, and each weapon has multiple skills. Use your weapon according to the situation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/6dd3ea64ae4b3b3e06c6fa2988f49111.poster.avif?t=1754899853\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/6dd3ea64ae4b3b3e06c6fa2988